%N A399643 Expansion of g^7/(5-4*g)^4, where g = 1+x*g^5 is the g.f. of A002294.
%H A399643 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A399643/b399643.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..917</a>
%F A399643 G.f.: (Sum_{k>=0} binomial(5*k+3,k) * x^k) * (Sum_{k>=0} binomial(5*k,k) * x^k)^3.
%F A399643 Sum_{k>=1} a(k-1) * x^k/k^2 = (1/8) * log( Sum_{k>=0} binomial(5*k+3,k) * x^k ).
%F A399643 a(n) = ((n+1)/2) * (binomial(5*n+4,n) + Sum_{k=0..n} 4^(n-k) * binomial(5*n+5,k)).
%F A399643 a(n) = ((n+1)/10) * Sum_{k=0..n+1} 4^(n+1-k) * binomial(5*n+6,k).
%F A399643 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 4^k * binomial(k+2,2) * binomial(5*n+6,n-k).
%o A399643 (PARI) a(n) = (n+1)*(binomial(5*n+4, n)+sum(k=0, n, 4^(n-k)*binomial(5*n+5, k)))/2;
